 | **Artifacts / reviewed snapshot** | Actual files, canonical artifact links and exact snapshot. Identify commit SHA, tree SHA, each changed file path plus content SHA-256, and diff base/head plus preserved diff SHA-256 as distinct identities; none substitutes for another. For uncommitted work, list changed paths/content hashes and the exact preserved diff. Reviews name the snapshot reviewed. |
